        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='55498' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='85630' x='5413' y='8714'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0'>     For the four-year period, The Global Superstore generated over 12 million dollars in revenue from over 25,000 orders and approximately 1.5 million dollars in profit with a profit margin of 12.5%. 
      The heavy discount as seen in the profitability deep-dive dashboard negatively affected the net profit. Therefore, the company should go slow on discounting prices as high sales does not mean high profit. 
    While the Technology category boosted the total revenue and profit, the Table sub-category(under the Furniture category) contributed mainly to the overall loss. The company should consider scraping this particular sub-category. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{07721003-BC11-4880-BF4A-961E58FB0B46}' />
